tronger repair ecosystem include?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Spare parts, diagnostic information and repair-friendly design\",\"hi\":\"Spare parts, diagnostic information and repair-friendly design\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Products permanently sealed against opening\",\"hi\":\"Products permanently sealed against opening\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"A ban on every form of replacement\",\"hi\":\"A ban on every form of replacement\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Fewer ways to identify faults\",\"hi\":\"Fewer ways to identify faults\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL English — Current-Affairs Passages Based on a Report or Editorial\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"hasMore\":true,\"nextCursor\":\"51191047-c1e0-4f99-8a54-1e6cd2c45d75\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:subtopic:v9:ec641501-33f2-438a-8a9a-ea3e10f7085c"]}